  "uprn": "100023402428",
  "decision_date": "04/04/2013",
  "description": "Erection of a first floor and second floor rear extension to the existing mixed-use building to incorporate the provision of retail storage space at first floor level and conversion of the existing three-bedroom flat at first and second floor level to two one-bedroom flats.",
  "site_name": "259",
  "last_updated_by": "Portal",
  "decision_target_date": "04/04/2013",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW3 1EA",
  "street_name": "High Street",
  "bo_system": "Portal",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "lapsed_date": "03/04/2016",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (830/RDP/P01 and P02, received on 30/01/2013, 830/RDP/FIG02, received on 24/01/2013 and Design and Access Statement, received on 30/01/2013) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 4 - No additional windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the north east and south west walls of the extension hereby approved and no additional doors inserted in the building without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - The flats hereby permitted shall not be occupied until full particulars and details of a scheme to insulate the premises against the transmission of airborne and impact sound between the floors and the internal walls of the flats and shop below has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given.",
    "Condition : 6 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the development hereby permitted begins arrangements shall be agreed in writing with the local planning authority and be put in place to ensure that, with the exception of disabled persons, no resident of the development shall obtain a resident's parking permit within any controlled parking zone which may be in force in the area (Hounslow Town Centre North & Hounslow Town Centre South) at any time.",
    "Condition : 8 - Before development commences, details of secure covered cycle parking for the use of the residents of the flats shall be submitted to and be approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The secure covered cycle parking shall be installed as agreed and be available for use before first occupation of either residential flat and thereafter it shall be retained for the use of the occupants of the flats only."
  ],
